  "subject": "a new father's three a.m. bottle feed in a dark kitchen while the mother finally sleeps",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien lullaby, a rocking 6/8 cradle song in the traditional Taiwanese style. A music-box ostinato on a simple pentatonic figure; nylon-string guitar arpeggios in 6/8; a soft cello pedal tone; felt-piano chords entering in the bridge. Hushed, dry and close, as if sung beside a baby's ear, the voice forward and everything else low. Soft, low male voice, intimate near-whisper singing with long exhaled phrase endings. 66 BPM, F major. Tender, sleepy and a little proud at three in the morning. No drums, no bass guitar, no string swell, no pop chorus build, no children's choir, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n三點 你閣咧哭\n媽媽 睏甲毋知人\n我赤跤 行入灶跤\n奶粉四匙 燒水一百二\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n滴一滴 佇手腕頂試\n無燒無冷 拄拄好\n\n[Chorus]\n嬰仔 嬰仔 細聲啊\n奶矸 一喙閣一喙\n窗仔外 機車走過去\n你的目睭 慢慢仔瞌\n\n[Verse]\n你的手 掠我一枝指頭仔\n掠牢牢 毋放\n我佇灶跤 慢慢仔搖\n冰箱嗡嗡 共咱鬥唱\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n奶矸 賰三十\n你喙 猶毋甘放\n\n[Chorus]\n嬰仔 嬰仔 細聲啊\n奶矸 一喙閣一喙\n窗仔外 機車走過去\n你的喙 猶一下一下咧欶\n\n[Bridge]\n四點 天猶未光\n阿爸 嘛足想欲睏\n毋過你的面 貼佇我的胸坎\n燒燒 細細 一粒仔\n\n[Chorus]\n嬰仔 嬰仔 細聲啊\n奶矸 已經食了了\n窗仔外 鳥仔開始咧叫\n媽媽起來 換阿爸睏\n\n[Outro]\n嬰仔 嬰仔 細聲啊\n阿爸 嘛欲睏矣",
